      "size": 40,
      "text": "Direction sketches, not specs.\n\nDrawn before the component library existed. Per design/collaboration.md, these get redrawn on the real @glyphh-ai/ui components once /design-sync brings them in.\n\nThe brief has since grown: return pages (checkout done or cancelled, a service connected), deploy with one-click hosts (Fly, AWS, Azure, GCP, DigitalOcean, Hetzner, any VPS), Add Glyphh to your AI, and Account. Those come with the redraw.\n\nComponents these sketches need that the library lacks are listed under Requests in collaboration.md.",
